dpT5AGzA","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:42:54","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463264406311","author_name":"椎間盤突出","comment_id":"18083710277677567","comment_text":"@meta.ai 有入門款嗎","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNdm8BkvxF","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:42:35","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"17982313535881437","comment_text":"有，精緻料理那掛最常被點名的就是這幾間：\n\n1.  logy、態芮 Taïrroir - 台北 Fine Dining 一線，logy是田原諒悟主理、態芮是法魂台菜代表，幾乎都是米其林常客。\n2.  渥達尼斯磨坊 Molino de Urdániz - 西班牙名廚 David Yárnoz 的分子料理，儀式感最重。\n\n想吃日料系的精緻路線就看 鮨天本、Adachi足立壽司、壽司芳，都是全熟客制、預約難到爆的那種。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNdhh8AJ4l","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:41:50","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841463264406311","author_name":"椎間盤突出","comment_id":"17915261844440383","comment_text":"@meta.ai 那有什麼精緻料理的推薦","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNdeu3kpn4","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:41:28","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18059533406606160","comment_text":"這篇留言最常被N刷點名的其實很集中，我幫你分一下類：\n\n火鍋是第一名賽道：詹記麻辣火鍋、橘色涮涮屋、八條老宅幾乎每串都有\n台菜老字號：明福台菜、雞家莊、欣葉 屬於聚餐回訪保證\n日料/燒肉/小吃：すし謙、上吉燒肉這類日料燒肉，還有雙月、廖家牛肉麵這種小吃麵食也是高頻口袋名單","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNdXseATo0","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:40:30","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841463264406311","author_name":"椎間盤突出","comment_id":"18153011119507416","comment_text":"@meta.ai 整理出現頻率較高的餐廳以及分類餐廳類型","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNdT3nkmop","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:39:59","error":null,"like_count":2,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841463556509148","author_name":"𝐁𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐝𝐚 𝐖.","comment_id":"17880573621653059","comment_text":"我還有買湯底自己在家煮😍","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNbcOREuOk","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:23:38","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841423632805218","author_name":"玲♡","comment_id":"18090364505559604","comment_text":"存","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNaDlwj_0y","created_at":"2026-08-18 22:11:32","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841464044496818","author_name":"J4Y L1AN","comment_id":"17898754791577174","comment_text":"要命了！居然有皮蛋麵！🤤🤤🤤\n（等有回台北再去享用！","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNW732kzIW","created_at":"2026-08-18 21:44:16","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841473224312177","author_name":"椪一下🙌🏻｜個人鴛鴦鍋","comment_id":"18106400039132419","comment_text":"想要舉手自我推薦！\n\n我們是在新莊的個人鴛鴦鍋-椪一下，我們有超多蔬菜的自助吧（少樣火鍋料）+雞蛋吃到飽！\n\n還有我們自己製作的鴨血豆腐、滷味，獨門超香超好吃！","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNWULrD-ZI","created_at":"2026-08-18 21:38:51","error":null,"like_count":71,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":3},{"author_id":"17841469743438913","author_name":"小宇","comment_id":"17905391466305045","comment_text":"置板凳","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DcNPPD1CU_E","created_at":"2026-08-18 20:36:59","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0}],"end_cursor":"AQHTwrDB_PaYRxuQfl-24wB5r3-gGwCpnPcgeATitCpWWaHmP9uCucxqt8p7whMFWFLi9WxJ60azBKwkKKtoe1zN9w","error":null,"has_next_page":true,"media_id":"18113719412301018","total_count":4303}],"retrieved_at":{"user_local":"2026-11-07T09:52:01.726+08:00","user_timezone":"Asia/Taipei","utc":"2026-11-07T01:52:01.726Z"}}
